# ERNativeUI documentation

The complete documentation is maintained online so this binary SDK archive
does not duplicate its large screenshot library.

[Open the documentation for ERNativeUI @PROJECT_VERSION@](https://github.com/Flammrock/ERNativeUI/blob/ERNativeUI-v@PROJECT_VERSION@/docs/README.md)

This link is pinned to the `ERNativeUI-v@PROJECT_VERSION@` release tag. It
therefore describes this SDK even after development continues on `main`.
